  "summary": "MatezStakingProgram.stake(uint256) quotes and transfers a uint128-truncated amount but credits the original uint256 to selfInvest, directInvest, teamInvest and orders. Stakes of 2^128 therefore pay zero MATEZ while satisfying reward thresholds. The first successful transaction made 16 such stakes and claimed 1.221735348112742185 MATEZ; repeated calls and copycats made 110 fraudulent reward payouts totalling 8104.939811537877595105 MATEZ.",
